  quarantineExitLines:
  - This is a mistake. I have notes. I can prove it.
  - Fine. In here I can keep counting without any interruption.
  killExitLines:
  - "The pattern\u2026 there was a pattern\u2026 I almost had it\u2026"
  - "Wait\u2026 mommy! I was so close to figuring it out\u2026"
